Additionally, be mindful of your body language and non-verbal cues. Maintain a positive and engaged demeanor, and avoid apologetic or hesitant language that might undermine your message. By being prepared, confident, and focused on the value of your contributions, you can effectively make your ideas and perspectives visible in group settings without coming across as overly self-promotional.

